{"version":2,"exportedAt":1774101811887,"story":{"title":"Robbie's Rocket Ride","userPrompt":"A robot helping his human friend go to mars.","authorStyleId":"beverly-cleary","readingLevel":"growing","illustrationStyleId":"cartoon_comic","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Lily loved stars. She dreamed of Mars! Her best pal was Robbie, a robot. Robbie wasn't like other toys. He could really talk and even... build!","illustrationPrompt":"Lily, a girl with bright eyes and pigtails, looking at a star chart. Robbie, a friendly robot with blinking lights, stands beside her. Background: A cozy bedroom with starry wallpaper. Colors: Warm yellows, blues, and purples. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774100854772,"durationMs":6208,"retries":0,"promptLength":1047,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A 7-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with medium curly red hair in pigtails with blue ribbons, big-expressive bright green eyes with dreamy, hopeful expression, wearing A yellow t-shirt with a star print, blue denim overalls, and white sneakers, with blue hair ribbons, freckles across her nose, gap between her two front teeth, small birthmark on her left wrist, always smiling. A medium shiny silver metal robot, round bright blue eyes with friendly, supportive expression, wearing Has a built-in tool belt with various compartments., with a small antenna on his head, a blinking red light on his chest, a small screen on his stomach that displays emoticons, two short antennae on his head, a slightly dented left shoulder, stocky build. Lily gazing at stars, dreamy expression. Robbie standing nearby, looking helpful and friendly. in Lily's Living Room. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"One day, Lily told Robbie her big wish. \"I want to visit Mars!\" she said. Robbie whirred. \"Mars? That's a fun plan. I will help you, Lily!\"","illustrationPrompt":"Lily excitedly pointing at a picture of Mars in a book. Robbie, looking determined, raises his metallic hand. Background: Lily's bedroom, showing more of her space-themed decorations. Colors: Reds, oranges, and browns for Mars, bright greens and blues for the room. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774100854087,"durationMs":5497,"retries":0,"promptLength":1055,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A 7-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with medium curly red hair in pigtails with blue ribbons, big-expressive bright green eyes with excited, hopeful expression, wearing A yellow t-shirt with a star print, blue denim overalls, and white sneakers, with blue hair ribbons, freckles across her nose, gap between her two front teeth, small birthmark on her left wrist, always smiling. A medium shiny silver metal robot, round bright blue eyes with thoughtful, determined expression, wearing Has a built-in tool belt with various compartments., with a small antenna on his head, a blinking red light on his chest, a small screen on his stomach that displays emoticons, two short antennae on his head, a slightly dented left shoulder, stocky build. Lily excitedly telling Robbie about her wish to visit Mars. Robbie whirring and looking thoughtful. in Lily's Living Room. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"Robbie gathered tools. He found boxes and tubes. Lily watched, amazed. \"What are you doing, Robbie?\" she asked. \"Making a rocket, of course!\"","illustrationPrompt":"Robbie surrounded by colorful boxes, tubes, and tools, building a rocket frame. Lily watching with wide eyes. Background: The rocket taking shape in the living room. Colors: Bright primary colors for the rocket parts. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774100853716,"durationMs":5126,"retries":0,"promptLength":1016,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A 7-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with medium curly red hair in pigtails with blue ribbons, big-expressive bright green eyes with amazed, curious expression, wearing A yellow t-shirt with a star print, blue denim overalls, and white sneakers, with blue hair ribbons, freckles across her nose, gap between her two front teeth, small birthmark on her left wrist, always smiling. A medium shiny silver metal robot, round bright blue eyes with focused, industrious expression, wearing Has a built-in tool belt with various compartments., with a small antenna on his head, a blinking red light on his chest, a small screen on his stomach that displays emoticons, two short antennae on his head, a slightly dented left shoulder, stocky build. Robbie gathering tools and boxes. Lily watching with amazement. in Lily's Living Room. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":4,"text":"It took days, but Robbie was speedy. He beeped and booped while he worked. Lily helped paint the rocket red. She added shiny stars, too.","illustrationPrompt":"Lily and Robbie painting the rocket red and adding star stickers. They are both smiling and covered in paint. Background: Close-up of the rocket being decorated. Colors: Bright red, yellow, and silver. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774100858206,"durationMs":4488,"retries":0,"promptLength":1047,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A 7-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with medium curly red hair in pigtails with blue ribbons, big-expressive bright green eyes with happy, engaged expression, wearing A yellow t-shirt with a star print, blue denim overalls, and white sneakers, with blue hair ribbons, freckles across her nose, gap between her two front teeth, small birthmark on her left wrist, always smiling. A medium shiny silver metal robot, round bright blue eyes with focused, efficient expression, wearing Has a built-in tool belt with various compartments., with a small antenna on his head, a blinking red light on his chest, a small screen on his stomach that displays emoticons, two short antennae on his head, a slightly dented left shoulder, stocky build. Robbie working on the rocket, beeping and booping. Lily painting the rocket red and adding stars. in Lily's Living Room. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"Finally, the rocket was ready! It wasn't very big, but it was perfect. \"Time for our trip!\" Robbie announced. Lily clapped her hands.","illustrationPrompt":"Lily and Robbie standing in front of the finished rocket, which is surprisingly small but charming. Lily is wearing a space helmet. Robbie is adjusting his antenna. Background: The finished rocket in the living room. Colors: Bright, cheerful colors. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774100979205,"durationMs":5632,"retries":0,"promptLength":1087,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A 7-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with medium curly red hair in pigtails with blue ribbons, big-expressive bright green eyes with excited, joyful expression, wearing A yellow t-shirt with a star print, blue denim overalls, and white sneakers, with blue hair ribbons, freckles across her nose, gap between her two front teeth, small birthmark on her left wrist, always smiling. A medium shiny silver metal robot, round bright blue eyes with proud, enthusiastic expression, wearing Has a built-in tool belt with various compartments., with a small antenna on his head, a blinking red light on his chest, a small screen on his stomach that displays emoticons, two short antennae on his head, a slightly dented left shoulder, stocky build. The finished rocket is revealed. Robbie announcing the trip. Lily clapping her hands with excitement. in Lily's Living Room. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":6,"text":"They climbed inside. Robbie pushed a button. The rocket rumbled. Then...WHOOSH! They were floating! Not to Mars, but still up HIGH!","illustrationPrompt":"Lily and Robbie inside the rocket, looking excited and a little surprised as they float upwards. Background: The living room shrinking below them. Colors: Soft blues and whites to show the feeling of floating. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774100860312,"durationMs":5530,"retries":0,"promptLength":1050,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A 7-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with medium curly red hair in pigtails with blue ribbons, big-expressive bright green eyes with surprised, thrilled expression, wearing A yellow t-shirt with a star print, blue denim overalls, and white sneakers, with blue hair ribbons, freckles across her nose, gap between her two front teeth, small birthmark on her left wrist, always smiling. A medium shiny silver metal robot, round bright blue eyes with determined, focused expression, wearing Has a built-in tool belt with various compartments., with a small antenna on his head, a blinking red light on his chest, a small screen on his stomach that displays emoticons, two short antennae on his head, a slightly dented left shoulder, stocky build. Lily and Robbie inside the rocket, blasting off. They are floating upwards. in Lily's Living Room (but now airborne). Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":7,"text":"They weren't on Mars, but they were floating above their town! They saw houses and trees. Everything looked so small and neat.","illustrationPrompt":"Lily and Robbie looking out the window of the rocket at the town below. They are pointing and smiling. Background: A bird's-eye view of a colorful, friendly town. Colors: Greens, blues, and browns for the town, bright colors for the rocket interior. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774100862546,"durationMs":4333,"retries":0,"promptLength":1032,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A 7-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with medium curly red hair in pigtails with blue ribbons, big-expressive bright green eyes with amazed, awestruck expression, wearing A yellow t-shirt with a star print, blue denim overalls, and white sneakers, with blue hair ribbons, freckles across her nose, gap between her two front teeth, small birthmark on her left wrist, always smiling. A medium shiny silver metal robot, round bright blue eyes with content, observant expression, wearing Has a built-in tool belt with various compartments., with a small antenna on his head, a blinking red light on his chest, a small screen on his stomach that displays emoticons, two short antennae on his head, a slightly dented left shoulder, stocky build. Lily and Robbie floating above their town, looking down at the houses and trees. in Above Lily's Town. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":8,"text":"\"It's like a dream!\" Lily said. Robbie smiled. \"Even if we're not on Mars, discovery is everywhere!\"","illustrationPrompt":"Close-up of Lily's face, filled with wonder and joy. Robbie looks at her with a kind expression. Background: The window of the rocket with the town blurred in the distance. Colors: Soft, warm colors to emphasize the feeling of wonder. Style: whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774100864697,"durationMs":6004,"retries":0,"promptLength":1029,"success":true,"prompt":"cartoon style, comic book illustration, bold outlines, expressive characters, vibrant colors, dynamic poses, child-friendly A 7-year-old girl with pale freckled skin, with medium curly red hair in pigtails with blue ribbons, big-expressive bright green eyes with amazed, thoughtful expression, wearing A yellow t-shirt with a star print, blue denim overalls, and white sneakers, with blue hair ribbons, freckles across her nose, gap between her two front teeth, small birthmark on her left wrist, always smiling. A medium shiny silver metal robot, round bright blue eyes with wise, gentle expression, wearing Has a built-in tool belt with various compartments., with a small antenna on his head, a blinking red light on his chest, a small screen on his stomach that displays emoticons, two short antennae on his head, a slightly dented left shoulder, stocky build. Lily expressing her amazement, Robbie smiling and sharing a philosophical thought. in Above Lily's Town. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":9,"text":"After a while, Robbie landed the rocket gently. It was back in their living room. The trip was over, but the fun wasn't.","illustrationPrompt":"The rocket gently landing back in the living room. Lily and Robbie are still inside, giggling. Background: The familiar living room, now looking even cozier. Colors: Warm, inviting colors. Style: whimsical children'